    EditorialLessonRecord("Class 11–12|Advanced Mole Concept|Empirical and molecular formulae",
        "explicit topic alias",
        "An empirical formula gives the simplest whole-number ratio of elements in a compound.\n\nA molecular formula gives the actual number of each type of atom in one molecule.",
